      "title": "Guide: Purpose and use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Image / first-last-frame video - Turbo\n\n## Purpose\nAnimate an input image, with an optional last frame to guide the ending.\n\n## Use\n1. Load the starting image and, if used, the last frame.\n2. Describe the action, camera motion and desired audio.\n3. Set output size, duration and seed, then run and review the result.\n\nWorkflow: turbo-fl2v-pod.json"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Image / first-last-frame video - Turbo\n\n## Purpose\nAnimate an input image, with an optional last frame to guide the ending.\n\n## Use\n1. Load the starting image and, if used, the last frame.\n2. Describe the action, camera motion and desired audio.\n3. Set output size, duration and seed, then run and review the result.\n\nWorkflow: turbo-fl2v-pod.json"
